---
import WorkItem from "@/components/WorkItem.astro";
---

<WorkItem
  company="Rápido Tickets"
  role="Co-Founder & DevOps Engineer"
  period="January 2025 - Present"
>
  <p>
    At Rápido Tickets, I built the production infrastructure from scratch for an
    event ticketing platform handling payments. I led the effort to achieve PCI
    DSS V4.0 SAQ D certification for secure credit card processing, implementing
    required security controls and operational procedures.
  </p>

  <p>
    Implemented comprehensive CI/CD pipelines, monitoring, and alerting
    infrastructure for production observability. I manage databases, debug
    production issues, and maintain system reliability across multiple services
    and integrations.
  </p>
</WorkItem>

<WorkItem
  company="Moni"
  role="Software Engineer, Backend / Infra"
  period="October 2025 - March 2026"
>
  <p>
    At Moni, I led the end-to-end delivery of the Moni Card, a Visa credit card
    program, including the integrations required for card operations and KYC
    verification. The team was recognized by a key partner as the fastest in our
    program tier to reach production at the time.
  </p>

  <p>
    I also integrated debit card payment processing and ACH push capabilities,
    expanding Moni's payments infrastructure and backend financial operations.
  </p>

  <p>
    Additionally, I built Terraform-based infrastructure for a production-ready
    financial operations deployment on GCP, enabling secure private connectivity
    between services.
  </p>
</WorkItem>

<WorkItem
  company="Stateless Solutions"
  role="Principal Software Engineer, Backend"
  period="July 2023 - November 2024"
>
  <p>
    At Stateless Solutions, I led a team of 3 backend engineers & our Gateway
    and Service API platform, enabling seamless integration of verified RPC data
    from network nodes for developers.
  </p>

  <p>
    I developed a pseudo-stateless client leveraging cryptographic attestations
    and Merkle proofs for Ethereum state validation without local storage. I
    built custom ethers.js and viem integrations, including a verifiable RPC
    transport, and led development of the Stateless CLI.
  </p>
  <p>
    Enhanced system observability using OpenTelemetry, Prometheus, and Grafana,
    while managing GCP infrastructure for our backend services.
  </p>
</WorkItem>

<WorkItem
  company="Pocket Network Inc."
  role="Software Engineer, Backend"
  period="August 2021 - July 2023"
  githubUrl="https://github.com/pokt-foundation"
  githubName="Pocket Network"
>
  <p>
    At Pocket Network, I maintained Portal API V1 and led the creation of Portal
    API V2, a full Go rewrite delivered from specification to production.
  </p>

  <p>
    Portal API V2 handled peak loads of 2 billion requests per day while
    reducing overall architecture costs by ~43%, cutting compute usage by ~90%
    versus V1, and improving latency by 2.5x under the same benchmark
    conditions.
  </p>

  <p>
    I also strengthened the platform through distributed regional architecture,
    improved observability, logging reductions of 80%, and caching improvements
    that reduced Redis memory usage by 90%.
  </p>

  <p>
    Additionally, I became a key internal expert on Pocket Protocol and
    Ethereum, advocated for fairer and more transparent reward distribution, and
    led exchange integrations that expanded $POKT to 5+ exchanges including
    KuCoin, Gate, and Okcoin.
  </p>
</WorkItem>
